    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, but could you go into a bit more detail on the specific enzymes and the amino acid sulfoxides involved? I really want to map out the exact step-by-step breakdown from the moment the cell wall is breached. Also, could you describe the sensation of that gas hitting the eye? Students always ask why it feels so sudden and sharp.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
